    "scenesThatPass": [
      "GEMMA: Oh, gimme a break. It's just an expression.\nKATE: Excuse me, what did you say?",
      "KATE: Excuse me?\nSQUIBBY: you didn’t think you were getting off that easy, did you?\nKATE: Squibby, what are you talking about?\nSQUIBBY: Well, seeing how you can’t afford a real crew, we thought we’d volunteer.",
      "ON SQUIBBY: making the rounds with another pitcher of mojitos to her depressed comrades, sitting on the top deck.\nSQUIBBY: At least no one was hurt.",
      "SQUIBBY: Yeah, easy for you to say.\nKATE: What is?",
      "KATE: Hello, Gemma.\nGEMMA: This 1s a joke, right? I mean, I‘m sorry for what I said but you’re not really coming on this boat, right?"
    ]
